  "question_type": "single_choice",
  "stem_markdown": "### 2. 函数 $f(x) = x^{2} - x$ 在区间[1,3]上的平均变化率为（）\n\nA. 6\n\nB. 3\n\nC. 2\n\nD. 1",
  "stem_html": "<h3>2. 函数 $f(x) = x^{2} - x$ 在区间[1,3]上的平均变化率为（）</h3>\n<p>A. 6</p>\n<p>B. 3</p>\n<p>C. 2</p>\n<p>D. 1</p>",
  "options": {
    "A": "6",
    "B": "3",
    "C": "2",
    "D": "1"
  },
  "answer": "B",
  "solution_markdown": "### 2. B\n\n**详解** $\\frac{f(3) - f(1)}{3 - 1} = \\frac{(3^2 - 3) - (1^2 - 1)}{2} = 3$ ，故选：B.",
  "solution_html": "<h3>2. B</h3>\n<p><strong>详解</strong> $\\frac{f(3) - f(1)}{3 - 1} = \\frac{(3^2 - 3) - (1^2 - 1)}{2} = 3$ ，故选：B.</p>",
